p 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blind\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-text\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\">Blind</a></span> it. </dd>\n</dl>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Raven_Gloves\" title=\"Raven Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/67/Gloves_Leather_E_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Raven_Gloves\" title=\"Raven Gloves\">Raven Gloves</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The raven is unsummoned if the Raven Gloves are unequipped.</li>\n<li>This spell counts as a level 3 <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Raven\" title=\"Find Familiar: Raven\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp/20px-Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp/30px-Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Familiar: Raven\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp/20px-Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Find_Familiar_Raven_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Raven\" title=\"Find Familiar: Raven\">Find Familiar: Raven</a>, which means:\n<ul><li>The wearer cannot use this at the same time as an any variant of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar\" title=\"Find Familiar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp/20px-Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp/30px-Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Familiar\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp/20px-Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8b/Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar\" title=\"Find Familiar\">Find Familiar</a>.</li>\n<li>The extra attack from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deepened_Pact\" title=\"Deepened Pact\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/18/Deepened_Pact_Icon.webp/20px-Deepened_Pact_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/18/Deepened_Pact_Icon.webp/30px-Deepened_Pact_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/18/Deepened_Pact_Icon.webp/40px-Deepened_Pact_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deepened Pact\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/18/Deepened_Pact_Icon.webp/20px-Deepened_Pact_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/18/Deepened_Pact_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deepened_Pact\" title=\"Deepened Pact\">Deepened Pact</a> with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Chain\" title=\"Pact of the Chain\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp/20px-Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp/30px-Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp/40px-Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pact of the Chain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp/20px-Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Find_Familiar_Imp_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Chain\" title=\"Pact of the Chain\">Pact of the Chain</a> works with this spell.</li>\n<li>The summoned raven has 1 HP and 12 AC like the level 1 version.</li></ul></li>\n<li>The raven's name is a <a href=\"/wiki/Cultural_References\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cultural References\">cultural reference</a> to both Edgar Allen Poe's poem \"The Raven\", and the raven named Quoth in the <a href=\"/wiki/Cultural_References#Discworld\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cultural References\">Discworld</a> novels of Terry Pratchett, himself a reference to Poe's poem.\n<ul><li>Specifically the repeated line: <i>Quoth the Raven, “Nevermore.”</i></li>\n<li>See also: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.poetryfoundation.org/poems/48860/the-raven\">\"The Raven\" full text</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034201\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.116 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.123 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4973/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 88889/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 34738/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.033/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1633068/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n117.49%  118.635     49 Template:Trim\n100.00%  100.972      1 -total\n 90.12%   90.999      1 Template:Feature_page\n 23.66%   23.887     11 Template:Icon_text\n 17.22%   17.392      6 Template:Icon_link\n 15.73%   15.886      3 Template:SpellAction\n 12.74%   12.863      1 Template:Creature\n 12.41%   12.528      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 11.57%   11.685     13 Template:Ifempty\n 10.09%   10.190      1 Template:Creature/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:15206-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715034201 and revision id 356640. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}